+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i41 : apply((entries gens J)#0,factor)                                       |
|                                                                             |
|          2       4     2       3               3   2            2   3       |
|o41 = {(u) (u + z) , (u) (u + z) (v), (u)(u + z) (v) , (u)(u + z) (v) , (u)(u|
|      -----------------------------------------------------------------------|
|             4            5     6                                            |
|      + z)(v) , (u + z)(v) , (v) }                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o41 : List                                                                   |
